    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/a5a3840fb751a33a1685f9383b1a030c.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=500 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/a5a3840fb751a33a1685f9383b1a030c.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/a5a3840fb751a33a1685f9383b1a030c.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds on a shattered continent, plunged into chaos after the fall of the Creator God. The absence of the divine has caused turmoil and unrest, leaving the world in endless darkness and confusion. You, summoned by mysterious forces, are tasked with vanquishing the factions and restoring the lost light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2026 or is it really that simple?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u201cThat Time I Got\u00a0Summoned to a New World as a Hero or Becoming a God\u201d</span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/14a1369f8e9559cc5657d5082d412d17.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Stylish Combos in a Scroll-Style Action World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, sweep, pierce, then spin through your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting and flashy battle journey, traverse perilous ruins, wield your weapon with smooth actions and sharp judgment, showcase your combo skills as you cut down hordes of enemies, challenge bosses, and and finish them off with a cinematic execution move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging foes + impactful combat (with everyone's favorite invincible dodge) = a satisfying gaming\u00a0experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/2411d88c23111eb8e371fbc91fb3fc6b.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/2411d88c23111eb8e371fbc91fb3fc6b.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/2411d88c23111eb8e371fbc91fb3fc6b.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/5d99787bf7a20d6d825f1a950745eee9.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enchant your moves\u00a0and Build Your Own Combat\u00a0in a world of swords and magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 8 types of skills\u2014Launch, Slam, Aerial, Guard, Dodge, Basic Attack, Charged Attack, and Divine Skills\u2014to build\u00a0your perfect loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into one of the bosses with a Divine Skill, dominate the skies with aerial combos, or trigger slick bullet-time dodges to outplay your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The possibilities are endless\u2014find the build that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/d0c95538ef24b0ee4b8e5e0b5d43285c.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/d0c95538ef24b0ee4b8e5e0b5d43285c.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/d0c95538ef24b0ee4b8e5e0b5d43285c.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your blade with elemental magic\u2014Fire, Ice, Wind, and Lightning magic, each with different effects, add variety to combat, allowing you to create deadly skill combos by weaving them into your moves.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, adapt, plan your strategy carefully during intense battles, and find the deadliest combinations to overcome crises and turn the tide in battle, or you won\u2019t reach your journey\u2019s end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse and distinctive build system, every battle feels refreshingly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/f6024bc0328b9e6f2f29066241764055.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/f6024bc0328b9e6f2f29066241764055.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/f6024bc0328b9e6f2f29066241764055.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c2f47c77044c51c65002e9ddcd81776f.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A rich variety of enemies ensures your adventure never gets boring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly assassins and jackal-headed pharaohs to colossal giants\u2014over 20 unique bosses await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy features distinct attack patterns and behaviors, offering fresh challenges in every encounter. Experience a combat system that\u2019s difficult but fair.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/914b3f8ee0c7bd63c808d8859be9f3b6.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/914b3f8ee0c7bd63c808d8859be9f3b6.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/914b3f8ee0c7bd63c808d8859be9f3b6.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/119f99875419fc572c1449c0a0fc0189.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Difficulty Modes for All Types of Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four difficulty levels\u2014from casual hack-and-slash to hardcore Souls-like\u00a0battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c89a749977a4f02951133e0177f974c3.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c89a749977a4f02951133e0177f974c3.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c89a749977a4f02951133e0177f974c3.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/9a22487bfc7196dc79ee1523f86e125a.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u00a0playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of diverse environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich and stylish moves and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+\u00a0skills and ability builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying combat with smooth controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ challenging bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental enchantments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight, engaging adventure\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are a team of freshly graduated university students, and through our passion and research\u00a0for gaming, we present this game, hoping to create a thrilling action game with excellent hit feedback for all players!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/a5a3840fb751a33a1685f9383b1a030c.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=500 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/a5a3840fb751a33a1685f9383b1a030c.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/a5a3840fb751a33a1685f9383b1a030c.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds on a shattered continent, plunged into chaos after the fall of the Creator God. The absence of the divine has caused turmoil and unrest, leaving the world in endless darkness and confusion. You, summoned by mysterious forces, are tasked with vanquishing the factions and restoring the lost light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2026 or is it really that simple?</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u201cThat Time I Got\u00a0Summoned to a New World as a Hero or Becoming a God\u201d</span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/14a1369f8e9559cc5657d5082d412d17.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Stylish Combos in a Scroll-Style Action World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, sweep, pierce, then spin through your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting and flashy battle journey, traverse perilous ruins, wield your weapon with smooth actions and sharp judgment, showcase your combo s