playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/d0c95538ef24b0ee4b8e5e0b5d43285c.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/d0c95538ef24b0ee4b8e5e0b5d43285c.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/d0c95538ef24b0ee4b8e5e0b5d43285c.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your blade with elemental magic\u2014Fire, Ice, Wind, and Lightning magic, each with different effects, add variety to combat, allowing you to create deadly skill combos by weaving them into your moves.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, adapt, plan your strategy carefully during intense battles, and find the deadliest combinations to overcome crises and turn the tide in battle, or you won\u2019t reach your journey\u2019s end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse and distinctive build system, every battle feels refreshingly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/f6024bc0328b9e6f2f29066241764055.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/f6024bc0328b9e6f2f29066241764055.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/f6024bc0328b9e6f2f29066241764055.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c2f47c77044c51c65002e9ddcd81776f.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A rich variety of enemies ensures your adventure never gets boring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly assassins and jackal-headed pharaohs to colossal giants\u2014over 20 unique bosses await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy features distinct attack patterns and behaviors, offering fresh challenges in every encounter. Experience a combat system that\u2019s difficult but fair.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/914b3f8ee0c7bd63c808d8859be9f3b6.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/914b3f8ee0c7bd63c808d8859be9f3b6.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/914b3f8ee0c7bd63c808d8859be9f3b6.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/119f99875419fc572c1449c0a0fc0189.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Difficulty Modes for All Types of Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four difficulty levels\u2014from casual hack-and-slash to hardcore Souls-like\u00a0battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c89a749977a4f02951133e0177f974c3.poster.avif?t=1755138853\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c89a749977a4f02951133e0177f974c3.webm?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/c89a749977a4f02951133e0177f974c3.mp4?t=1755138853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374060/extras/9a22487bfc7196dc79ee1523f86e125a.avif?t=1755138853\" width=1250 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u00a0playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of diverse environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich and stylish moves and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+\u00a0skills and ability builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying combat with smooth controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ challenging bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental enchantments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight, engaging adventure\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are a team of freshly graduated university students, and through our passion and research\u00a0for gaming, we present this game, hoping to create a thrilling action game with excellent hit feedback for all players!</i></p>",
